# Sub-tick interpolation of the particle systems. Row grammar and the
# leave-one-out: see games/spyro-1/particles-subtick-corpus.manifest.
#
# shady-oasis-flame: the sparks the flame breath throws off the oasis rock.
# The row names the larger of the two established puffs, 302 px at 848 against
# 382 px at 850, which crosses 4.1 px over the interval. At V=848 the same
# puff had just spawned and resolves to no component at 846, which is why the
# row sits one tick later.
shady-oasis-flame.bk2 | 850 | blob=296.8,188.3 tol=0.5 step=4
